PATH_DISAPPEARANCE_RATE

CAUSAL_NECESSITY

REVERSIBILITY_INDEX

ALTERNATIVE_SUPPRESSION

COUNTERFACTUAL_ERASURE

The critical question:

> Was this outcome necessary—or did the system simply stop remembering the roads not taken?




---

VI. 🔮 ORACLE — COUNTERFACTUAL OBSERVATORY

