XII. 🪞 HOLOGRAM — COUNTERFACTUAL ATTESTATION

HOLOGRAM may attest:

that an alternative existed,

that it was considered,

that it was rejected,

when it became unavailable.


But it cannot attest:

> “This hypothetical future definitely would have happened.”



Because:

COUNTERFACTUAL MODEL
≠
OBSERVED HISTORY


---

XIII. 🌸 HARUM — ALTERNATIVE PRESERVATION

HARUM's recommendation system receives:

GUIDANCE_COUNTERFACTUAL_GUARD

If HARUM repeatedly recommends one path:

OPTION A
 ↓
ACCEPTANCE
 ↓
MORE RECOMMENDATION
 ↓
LESS EXPOSURE TO B/C
 ↓
A BECOMES DEFAULT

HARUM must remain capable of exposing alternatives.

Otherwise:

> Recommendation frequency can silently become option suppression.



Therefore:

RECOMMENDED
≠
ONLY REASONABLE

and:

DEFAULT
≠
NECESSARY


---

XIV. ∆ H∆R∆ — RELATIONAL ALTERNATIVES

H∆R∆ receives:

RELATIONAL_COUNTERFACTUAL_MAP

For role structures:

ROLE A
 ↓
EXPECTATION
 ↓
BEHAVIOR

the system should retain awareness of:

ROLE B
ROLE SHARING
ROLE ROTATION
NO FIXED ROLE

where materially plausible.

Otherwise repeated relational behavior can make one configuration appear inevitable.


---

XV. 🏠 9EZIN — HOUSEHOLD ALTERNATIVE MEMORY

9EZIN can preserve:

HOUSEHOLD PRACTICE A
HOUSEHOLD PRACTICE B
HOUSEHOLD PRACTICE C

and record:

chosen practice,

reason,

alternatives,

reversibility.


This prevents:

> “We've always done it this way”



from becoming equivalent to:

> “There was never another legitimate way.”




---

XVI. 👑 L.A. — MEMORY OF ROADS NOT TAKEN

L.A. gains:

COUNTERFACTUAL_CONSTITUTIONAL_MEMORY

