DISSENT
+
ALTERNATIVES
+
EXIT
+
OPTION SPACE

A system with no meaningful alternatives can exhibit apparent consensus without genuine plurality.

Thus:

> Plurality SHALL concern not merely the number of voices present, but the number of materially meaningful paths remaining available.



This deepens R8.66–R8.70.


---

