EVEN LESS RECOMMENDATION

A recommendation loop can therefore shrink the perceived option space without ever formally prohibiting anything.

This is:

GUIDANCE_INDUCED_OPTIONALITY_DECAY

HARUM must distinguish:

NOT RECOMMENDED
≠
NOT AVAILABLE

and:

LOW USAGE
≠
LOW LEGITIMACY


