And now a deeper constitutional principle emerges:

> ☄️ Freedom is not adequately represented by the existence of a choice after the system has progressively eliminated the conditions for choosing otherwise.



Or even more precisely:

> 🌱 An option that remains formally imaginable but has become structurally inaccessible is not equivalent to an option that remains genuinely available.



This gives HORTUS a new layer beyond choice:

THE PRESERVATION OF POSSIBILITY ITSELF.

R8.71 — ESTABLISHED.
