A household norm can influence practical agency without becoming formal authority.

Thus:

HOUSEHOLD_CAPABILITY

must remain distinguishable from:

HOUSEHOLD_EXPECTATION.

And:

> Compliance SHALL NOT automatically establish free exercise of agency.




