while the historical record shows:

> The system progressively shaped the environment in which that behavior emerged.




---

XV. 🪞 HOLOGRAM — FEEDBACK ATTESTATION

HOLOGRAM may attest:

what recommendation was shown,

what response occurred,

what state changed,

what option was presented,

what system intervention followed.


But:

OBSERVED FEEDBACK
≠
PROOF OF INTENT

Attestation establishes the event.

It does not establish psychological motive.


