R8.74 therefore asks:

> What happens when a system becomes part of the causal chain that produces the evidence by which the system itself is constitutionally validated?



This is not merely feedback.

It is:

REFLEXIVE_CONSTITUTIONALITY

The system has become an object and a participant in its own validation process.


---

I. 🪞 OBSERVATION BECOMES PART OF THE OBSERVED SYSTEM

The classical model assumes:

SYSTEM
 ↓
OBSERVATION
 ↓
