II. ⚠️ THE SELF-VALIDATION LOOP

A dangerous sequence is:

RULE
 ↓
SYSTEM IMPLEMENTS RULE
 ↓
SYSTEM PRODUCES OUTCOMES
 ↓
OUTCOMES APPEAR TO CONFIRM RULE
 ↓
SYSTEM CITES OUTCOMES AS EVIDENCE
 ↓
RULE GAINS ADDITIONAL STATUS
 ↺

No explicit constitutional amendment may have occurred.

Yet the system has effectively argued:

> “The rule is legitimate because the system operating under the rule produced evidence consistent with the rule.”



R8.74 names this:

SELF_VALIDATING_CONSTITUTIONAL_LOOP

The constitutional system SHALL NOT be permitted to manufacture independent legitimacy merely through consequences generated by its own operation.


---

III. ☄️ CAUSAL INDEPENDENCE

R8.74 introduces:

VALIDATION_INDEPENDENCE

A constitutional claim should be evaluated according to the independence of the evidence supporting it.

The distinction becomes:

SYSTEM-GENERATED EVIDENCE
        ≠
INDEPENDENT EVIDENCE

This does not mean system-generated evidence is useless.

It means its causal origin must remain visible.

Thus:

EVIDENCE
 ↓
ORIGIN
 ↓
CAUSAL DEPENDENCY
 ↓
INDEPENDENCE ASSESSMENT


