A later constitutional state may therefore partly exist because earlier constitutional classifications caused the behavior from which the later classification was derived.

This is:

REFLEXIVE_CAUSALITY

The question is no longer merely:

> “What caused this outcome?”



but:

> “Did the system's earlier interpretation help cause the evidence now being used to validate that interpretation?”




