VII. 🦆 FOOL — THE ANCHOR CHALLENGE

FOOL asks:

1. Where did the anchor originate?


2. Who controls it?


3. When did it exist?


4. Can the system alter it?


5. Did the system influence its creation?


6. Is the anchor downstream from the system?


7. Can another observer independently verify it?


8. Does the anchor predate the disputed claim?


9. What happens if the anchor is removed?


10. Are there competing anchors?


11. Who selected this anchor?


12. Has “external” become merely a label?



And:

> Is this truly an anchor—or have we simply moved the mirror one room farther away?




---

