TEMPORAL_OVERLAP

CAUSAL_CONFLICT

INDEPENDENCE_COMPARISON

RESOLUTION_SPACE

UNRESOLVED_CORE

The important concept is:

> The system must be able to represent unresolved disagreement without prematurely converting it into a decision.




---

V. 🔮 ORACLE — CONFLICT OBSERVATORY

