ANCHOR_CONFLICT_EXPLANATION

Mentor must be able to state:

ANCHOR A SAYS WHAT?
ANCHOR B SAYS WHAT?
WHY DO THEY APPEAR TO CONFLICT?
WHAT DO THEY EACH ACTUALLY ESTABLISH?
WHAT IS AGREED?
WHAT IS DISPUTED?
WHAT REMAINS UNKNOWN?

No false certainty.

No synthetic consensus.

No hidden suppression.


