UNCERTAINTY_PLURALITY_GUARD

Where multiple materially supported interpretations remain:

A
B
C

EIRENE preserves the distinction between:

A IS TRUE

and:

A IS CURRENTLY SELECTED FOR LIMITED ACTION

This is crucial.

Operational selection does not erase epistemic plurality.


---

VIII. 🧭 MENTOR — UNCERTAINTY EXPLANATION

MENTOR receives:

UNCERTAINTY_EXPLANATION

It must be able to expose:

KNOWN
 ↓
INFERRED
 ↓
DISPUTED
 ↓
UNKNOWN
 ↓
ASSUMPTIONS
 ↓
DECISION
 ↓
REVERSIBILITY

