 ↓
STRUCTURAL DEPENDENCY
 ↓
"RULE"

This connects directly to R8.56.

The constitutional danger is:

PROVISIONAL_AUTHORITY_DRIFT

A temporary authority becomes embedded because reversing it becomes increasingly inconvenient.


