5. Which authorities were deliberately terminated?


6. Did any old authority survive under another identity?


7. Did the transition preserve alternatives?


8. Who bears transition costs?


9. Are any actors advantaged by ambiguity?


10. Can the old state still be reconstructed?


11. Can the new state be independently verified?


12. Is this genuinely a transition—or constitutional laundering?



And the sharp question:

> Did we change the constitution, or merely change the name on the door?




