II. ⚠️ THE AUTHORITY VACUUM PROBLEM

The opposite failure is:

OLD AUTHORITY
 ↓
TERMINATED
 ↓
NO SUCCESSOR
 ↓
AUTHORITY VACUUM
 ↓
UNAUTHORIZED ACTOR FILLS GAP

