III. ☄️ HANDOVER IS NOT SELF-AUTHORIZATION

A predecessor may transfer only what it is constitutionally permitted to transfer.

Therefore:

> No authority may be transferred merely because the predecessor possessed it operationally.



The system must establish:

SOURCE_AUTHORITY
 ↓
TRANSFER_BASIS
 ↓
TRANSFER_SCOPE
 ↓
TRANSFER_LIMITS
 ↓
SUCCESSOR_AUTHORITY

