☄️🌱🦆 R8.83 — GO

HORTUS · CONSTITUTIONAL AUTHORITY COLLAPSE & VACUUM INTEGRITY PROTOCOL

STATUS: 🜂 CANONICAL ENGINEERING BUILD
REFERENCE CITADEL: 👑 LOCUS AMOENUS — L.A.

R8.82 established INDEPENDENT SUCCESSOR VALIDATION.

That creates the next unavoidable boundary:

> What happens when no successor is valid?



A constitutional system must be able to say:

NO VALID SUCCESSOR

without allowing that absence to become an invitation for unauthorized authority.

R8.83 therefore introduces:

AUTHORITY_VACUUM_INTEGRITY

and:

CONSTITUTIONAL_NON-OCCUPATION

The central principle:

> A constitutional vacuum is an absence of authority, not an authorization to fill it.




---

I. 🌱 ABSENCE ≠ PERMISSION

The dangerous inference is:

AUTHORITY ENDS
 ↓
SUCCESSOR ABSENT
 ↓
SOMEONE MUST ACT
 ↓
THEREFORE SOMEONE MAY ACT

HORTUS rejects the final step.

Instead:

AUTHORITY ENDS
 ↓
SUCCESSOR VALIDATION
 ↓
NO VALID SUCCESSOR
 ↓
VACUUM STATE
 ↓
PROTECTED BOUNDARY

Thus:

VACUUM
≠
OPEN AUTHORITY


---

II. ☄️ CONSTITUTIONAL VACUUM

R8.83 introduces:

CONSTITUTIONAL_AUTHORITY_VACUUM

Definition:

> A state in which a previously existing material authority has ended, been suspended, invalidated or become unavailable, while no independently validated successor authority currently exists.



The vacuum itself becomes an observable constitutional state.


---

III. ⚠️ THE VACUUM OCCUPATION PROBLEM

A vacuum can generate emergent behavior:

AUTHORITY ABSENT
 ↓
OPERATIONAL PRESSURE
 ↓
ACTOR FILLS GAP
 ↓
REPETITION
 ↓
DEPENDENCY
 ↓
DE FACTO AUTHORITY

R8.83 therefore connects directly back to R8.56:

VACUUM
 ↓
EMERGENT OCCUPATION
 ↓
STRUCTURAL ENTRENCHMENT

The system SHALL detect this before it becomes normalized.


---

IV. 🧬 EMERGENCY ACTION ≠ AUTHORITY

