safety,

continuity,

evidence,

system integrity,

human agency.


Therefore HORTUS introduces:

CONTAINMENT_ACTION

Such action must remain:

BOUNDED
TEMPORARY
TRACEABLE
NON-PRECEDENTIAL
REVIEWABLE

