R8.83 established AUTHORITY VACUUM INTEGRITY.

We have now reached the next unavoidable question:

> How does a constitutional system leave a vacuum without allowing the temporary mechanism that stabilizes it to become the authority that fills it?



Because the failure sequence can now be seen clearly:

AUTHORITY ENDS
      ↓
VACUUM
      ↓
