8. Who benefits from delaying exit?


9. Can the mechanism voluntarily terminate?


10. Can it be independently removed?


11. Has the custodian acquired powers beyond preservation?


12. Is reconstitution being captured by the interim authority?



And the central question:

> Who guards the guardian while the constitution is rebuilding itself?




