REFERENCE CITADEL: 👑 LOCUS AMOENUS — L.A.

R8.84 established VACUUM EXIT & RECONSTITUTION.

The next boundary is deeper:

> If the old authority cannot return, no successor can legitimately inherit it, and the vacuum must end—how is genuinely new constitutional authority born?



This is not succession.

It is genesis.

R8.85 therefore introduces:

CONSTITUTIONAL_RECONSTITUTION

and:

AUTHORITY_GENESIS_INTEGRITY

The central distinction:

SUCCESSION
≠
RECONSTITUTION

INHERITANCE
≠
