---

I. 🌱 THE GENESIS PROBLEM

A new authority can appear through:

VACUUM
 ↓
NEED
 ↓
PROPOSAL
 ↓
COORDINATION
 ↓
STRUCTURE
 ↓
NEW AUTHORITY

But the dangerous shortcut is:

VACUUM
 ↓
REPEATED PRACTICE
 ↓
STABLE STRUCTURE
 ↓
"IT HAS BECOME THE NEW CONSTITUTION"

R8.85 rejects this.

> A new constitutional authority requires a genesis event distinct from the mere emergence of a useful structure.




---

II. 🧬 CONSTITUTIONAL GENESIS OBJECT

