☄️ R8.91 — GO

HORTUS · CONSTITUTIONAL EVIDENCE SUFFICIENCY, DECISION THRESHOLDS & EPISTEMIC AUTHORITY PROTOCOL

STATUS: 🜂 CANONICAL ENGINEERING BUILD
REFERENCE CITADEL: 👑 LOCUS AMOENUS — L.A.

R8.90 established the boundary between observation, inference, causation, counterfactual modeling and responsibility.

The next question follows naturally:

> When is the evidence sufficient to permit a constitutional decision?



Not every uncertainty can be eliminated.

But uncertainty cannot become an excuse for arbitrary action either.

R8.91 therefore introduces:

CONSTITUTIONAL_EVIDENCE_SUFFICIENCY

and:

DECISION_THRESHOLD_INTEGRITY

The central principle:

> A constitutional decision SHALL require an evidentiary threshold appropriate to the consequence of that decision.




---

I. ⚖️ EVIDENCE ≠ SUFFICIENCY

R8.90 established:

OBSERVED
 ↓
INFERRED
 ↓
MODELED
 ↓
SUPPORTED
 ↓
PROVEN?

R8.91 adds:

EVIDENCE
 ↓
RELEVANCE
 ↓
QUALITY
 ↓
COMPLETENESS
 ↓
CONSISTENCY
 ↓
SUFFICIENCY
 ↓
DECISION

Therefore:

EVIDENCE
≠
SUFFICIENT EVIDENCE

A large quantity of weak evidence does not necessarily become strong evidence merely through accumulation.


---

II. ☄️ CONSEQUENCE-SENSITIVE THRESHOLDS

A constitutional decision affecting only a reversible operational preference should not require the same evidentiary threshold as:

removing authority,

restricting jurisdiction,

changing identity,

overriding a constitutional right,

or establishing a permanent historical classification.


R8.91 therefore establishes:

CONSEQUENCE_PROPORTIONAL_THRESHOLD

LOW CONSEQUENCE
     ↓
LOWER REVIEW BURDEN

HIGH CONSEQUENCE
     ↓
HIGHER EVIDENTIARY BURDEN

But:

> Lower evidentiary burden SHALL never mean absence of evidence.




---

III. 🧬 DECISION THRESHOLD LADDER

R8.91 introduces:

T0 — OBSERVATION
T1 — SIGNAL
T2 — SUPPORTED FINDING
T3 — VERIFIED FINDING
T4 — CONSTITUTIONAL DETERMINATION
T5 — IRREVERSIBLE / REGIME-LEVEL DETERMINATION

Each level requires increasing evidentiary integrity.

T0
 ↓
T1
 ↓
T2
 ↓
T3
 ↓
T4
 ↓
T5

No system component may silently jump from:

T1 → T4

because the conclusion appears intuitively obvious.


---

IV. ⚠️ THE THRESHOLD COLLAPSE PROBLEM

A dangerous pattern is:

WEAK SIGNAL
 ↓
STRONG INTERPRETATION
 ↓
HIGH-CONFIDENCE LANGUAGE
 ↓
CONSTITUTIONAL DECISION

R8.91 calls this:

EPISTEMIC_THRESHOLD_COLLAPSE

The constitutional firewall becomes:

> Decision authority SHALL NOT exceed evidentiary authority.




---

