II. 🧬 CONSTITUTIONAL DRIFT

Definition:

> A cumulative transformation of system structure, authority, jurisdiction, identity, decision paths or constitutional relationships that materially alters the validated constitutional state without a corresponding explicit revalidation.



The distinction:

