XX. 🜂 R9.09 LAW

> A constitutionally bounded intervention SHALL remain temporally and materially bounded unless its continuation is independently revalidated. Where feasible, material constitutional state transitions SHALL remain reversible, provenance-traceable and historically reconstructable. Repetition, operational usefulness, dependency or normalization SHALL NOT independently convert temporary authority into permanent constitutional authority.



