R9.10 formalizes:

OPTIONALITY_DECAY

OPTIONS
 ↓
REPETITION
 ↓
DEPENDENCY
 ↓
FEWER OPTIONS
 ↓
LOCK-IN

A reduction in available alternatives is itself a constitutional signal.

Therefore:

> Loss of alternatives SHALL remain observable even where no explicit authority expansion occurs.




